              notes: '[[7 9 11 12] [14 12 11 9] [7 9 11 12] [14 12 11 9]] [[12 11 9 7 5 4] [2 4 5 7 9 11] [12 11 9 7 5 4] [2 4 5 7 9 11]] [[0 4 7 11] [0 4 7 11] [2 5 9 12] [2 5 9 12]] [[12 11 9 7] [9 7 5 4] [5 4 2 0] [2 0 2 4]] [[5 5 5 5] [7 7 7 7] [9 9 9 9] [11 11 11 11]] [[12 12 12 12] [12 12 12 12] [11 12 11 9] [11 12 11 9]] [[4 5 7 9 11 12] [11 9 7 5 4 2] [4 5 7 9 11 12] [11 9 7 5 4 2]] [[11 9 11 12] 12@4 ~ 7@2]' },
